&lt;h1 id="overview"&gt;Overview
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;剧情概要&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When a foreign student arrives in the coastal town of Summit Bay for a gap year with the Hayes family, he’s looking for more than just a good time — he needs a clean slate to rediscover who he is and what he wants from life. But between school drama, forbidden romance, wild parties, and the growing influence of a seductive, otherworldly force&amp;hellip; he soon realizes this new world is anything but ordinary.&lt;br&gt;
In DESIRIUM, you will develop romantic and increasingly sexual relationships with a number of attractive women, each with her own personality, secrets, and desires — but expect trouble when you try to be the city&amp;rsquo;s most wanted man…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
